{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:20:30+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mega Fast Food: A Fast Food Simulator Game", "steam_appid": 2102530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/8b68d1e975b9b8db8eac479482ad7d0a.avif?t=1793679087\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras_big/8b68d1e975b9b8db8eac479482ad7d0a.webp?t=1793679087 width=1560 height=505 /></span><br><strong>Version 2.1: Mega Fast Food now speaks your language.</strong> The whole game is translated into 17 languages. It follows your Steam language, or pick another one in Settings. Version 2.0, our first major update, rebuilt the game from the kitchen up: see the update notes for everything that changed.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your restaurant, your rules</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/ccdc1104466f3b9a130f7cd5115c4a75.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Start with an empty lot and build a fast-food restaurant from scratch: walls, floors, doors, kitchens, booths and café tables, then paint it any colour you like. A build menu shows what every item does and what it costs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design every dish</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/d6066c20c0a0a1be0af9934fceb942f5.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Stack burgers, fries, pizza, hot dogs, ice cream and hundreds of other ingredients on a tray in the food designer, name your creation and set its price. The game tells you what the dish is worth, what its ingredients cost and what customers will think of the price.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A kitchen that really cooks</h2>Your cooks make the food on your menu on grills, deep fryers, ovens and ice cream machines and stock your serving shelves. Customers can only order what's ready, so keep the kitchen running.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire a crew with real jobs</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/6631033e2f6ed4bf391c24fb06fa1f03.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Cashiers take orders, cooks cook, servers bring trays to the table, cleaners clear tables and pick up litter, dishwashers keep the dishes flowing and managers keep everyone working faster. Every applicant has traits that change how they work and how customers feel about them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Happy customers, growing reputation</h2>Customers arrive in groups, queue, order, pay and find a seat. They notice long queues, dirty tables, litter and prices far above what the food is worth. Every visit shapes your reputation, and reputation decides how busy you get.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open the drive-thru</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/46e51a441aa098cab643d4b76029a49f.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Put a drive-thru window in the wall by the road, give it a cashier and serve the cars that pull in.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build it your way</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/3ae708db5b6903a71e582de8c19dc88b.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Hundreds of walls, floors and objects, each explained in the build menu, plus paint and bulldoze tools to get every detail right.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn your stars</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/8395e337c06750168228aecc15fcce1c.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Work toward your restaurant's five stars, each with a cash reward, or build without limits in Sandbox mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now in 17 languages</h2>Version 2.0, our first major update, rebuilt the game: a working kitchen and drive-thru, real staff jobs, customer satisfaction and reputation, goals, a brand-new interface and autosaves. Version 2.1 brings it to 17 languages. See the update notes for everything that changed.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your restaurant, your rules</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/ccdc1104466f3b9a130f7cd5115c4a75.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Start with an empty lot and build a fast-food restaurant from scratch: walls, floors, doors, kitchens, booths and café tables, then paint it any colour you like. A build menu shows what every item does and what it costs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design every dish</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102530/extras/d6066c20c0a0a1be0af9934fceb942f5.avif?t=1793679087\" width=1232 height=692 /></span><br>Stack burgers, fries, pizza, hot dogs, ice cream and hundreds of other ingredients on a tray in the food designer, name your creation and set its price. The game tells you what the dish is worth, what its ingredients cost and what customers will think of the price.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A kitchen that really cooks</h2>Your cooks make the food on your menu on grills, deep fryers, ovens and ice cream machines and stock your serving shelves. Customers can only order what's ready, so keep the kitchen running.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire a crew with real jobs</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea